# Single source of truth for the pinned UniFi OS Server installer: the input of
# the private-API model extractor (provider/pkg/uos) and the image of the
# private e2e controller. See ./SOURCE for provenance.
#
# Shell-sourceable (read by uos/fetch.sh and the Makefile via `include`) AND
# parsed by the Go side (uos.ReadPin). Pin ties, checked by tests and by
# `pulumi-gen-unifi uos-extract`:
#   - UOS_NETWORK_VERSION == SPEC_VERSION in openapi/pin.env;
#   - the installer's own webapps/ROOT/api-docs/integration.json has SHA-256
#     == SPEC_SHA256 in openapi/pin.env.
# To bump: change all six values here (+ re-verify the size and checksum
# against fw-update.ubnt.com), then re-run `make private-check`.
UOS_VERSION=5.1.15
UOS_PLATFORM=linux-x64
UOS_URL=https://fw-download.ubnt.com/data/unifi-os-server/24e0-linux-x64-5.1.15-926621de-c9d7-48cd-8921-a0ff3eebd3f4.15-x64
UOS_SIZE=874927011
UOS_SHA256=04c8e401eb34330fe99d94f35aa351e0e0e97895f0d9a4b459ff34fb50cad2bb
UOS_NETWORK_VERSION=10.4.57
